      "message": "Thanks for fixing this!\n\nUnfortunately CONFIG_POSIX_API (required to have POSIX headers) enables CONFIG_POSIX_BASE_DEFINITIONS which enables lots of stuff we don\u0027t need (22 files). All of these are `select`, so we can\u0027t just disable them in config.\n\nThis is not super painful - we just compile code that will be dropped by linker, so let\u0027s merge it!",
